<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-layout="vertical" data-topbar="light" data-sidebar="dark" data-sidebar-size="lg" data-sidebar-image="none" data-preloader="disable" data-theme="default" data-theme-colors="default" data-bs-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <%- include('../partials/ui-state-init') %>
    <title>Requests | CIPRMS-CSPC-CIRL</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/cirl-logo.jpg">
    <!-- Layout config Js -->
    <script src="/velzon/assets/js/layout.js"></script>
    <!-- Bootstrap Css -->
    <link href="/velzon/assets/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />
    <!-- Icons Css -->
    <link href="/velzon/assets/css/icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />
    <!-- App Css -->
    <link href="/velzon/assets/css/app.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />
    <!-- Custom Css -->
    <link href="/velzon/assets/css/custom.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/velzon/assets/css/ciprms-bridge.css?v=20260925d">
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
      #req-toast {
          position: fixed;
          bottom: 30px;
          right: 30px;
          padding: 12px 24px;
          border-radius: 6px;
          color: white;
          font-weight: 600;
          box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
          opacity: 0;
          transition: opacity 0.3s;
          z-index: 9999;
      }
      .table-card {
          border-radius: 12px;
          border: none;
          box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
          background: white;
      }
      .table thead th {
          background-color: #f3f6f9;
          color: #878a99;
          font-size: 11px;
          font-weight: 700;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          border: none;
          padding: 15px 20px;
      }
      .table tbody td {
          padding: 15px 20px;
          border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f6f9;
          font-size: 13px;
          vertical-align: middle;
      }
      .badge-soft-pending { background-color: #fff3e0; color: #ff9800; }
      .badge-soft-fulfilled { background-color: #e8f5e9; color: #4caf50; }
      .badge-soft-rejected { background-color: #ffebee; color: #f44336; }

      .search-box-container {
          position: relative;
          max-width: 250px;
      }
      .search-box-container .form-control {
          padding-left: 15px;
          border-radius: 6px;
          border: 1px solid #e9ebec;
          font-size: 13px;
      }

      /* Section switcher — same convention as administrator/partnership_requests.ejs */
      .section-tabs { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .section-tab {
          padding: .45rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600;
          cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all .18s;
          display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; background: #f3f4fa; color: #495057;
      }
      .section-tab:hover { background: #e8eaf6; color: #405189; }
      .section-tab.active { background: #405189; color: #fff; border-color: #405189; }

      /* ── College Requests tab (2026-11 follow-up) — ported from the former standalone
         views/auth. personnel/college_requests.ejs page, which this tab replaces. ── */
      .cdr-filter-tabs { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .cdr-filter-tab {
          padding: .45rem 1.15rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600;
          cursor: pointer; border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all .18s;
          display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; background: #f3f4fa; color: #495057;
      }
      .cdr-filter-tab:hover { background: #e8eaf6; color: #405189; }
      .cdr-filter-tab.active { background: #405189; color: #fff; border-color: #405189; }
      .cdr-doc-chip {
          display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; background: #f3f4fa; color: #495057;
          border-radius: 16px; padding: .3rem .8rem; font-size: .8rem; margin: .15rem;
      }
      .cdr-history-item { border-left: 2px solid #e9ebec; padding: .25rem 0 .25rem 1rem; margin-left: .4rem; position: relative; }
      .cdr-history-item::before {
          content: ''; position: absolute; left: -5px; top: .5rem; width: 8px; height: 8px;
          border-radius: 50%; background: #405189;
      }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cdr-filter-tab { background: #262d3d; color: #ced4da; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cdr-filter-tab:hover { background: #2f3749; color: #7094f5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cdr-doc-chip { background: rgba(96,126,224,.18); color: #a9bcf5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cdr-history-item { border-left-color: rgba(255,255,255,.15); }

      /* ── CSPC-F-CIRL-04 "Documents Request Form" — styled to resemble the
         official paper form (bordered label/value rows) instead of a generic
         Bootstrap two-column grid. ── */
      .dr-form-header {
          display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
          padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 3px solid #405189;
      }
      .dr-form-header img { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .dr-form-header .dr-form-title { font-weight: 700; color: #405189; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .3px; }
      .dr-form-header .dr-form-subtitle { font-size: .75rem; color: #878a99; margin: 0; }
      .dr-form-header .dr-form-code { margin-left: auto; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #405189; text-align: right; }

      .dr-form-table { border: 1px solid #dfe3ea; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 16px; }
      .dr-row { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe3ea; }
      .dr-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
      .dr-label {
          flex: 0 0 230px; background: #f8f9fb; font-weight: 600; font-size: .78rem;
          text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px; color: #495057;
          padding: 12px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; border-right: 1px solid #dfe3ea;
      }
      .dr-value { flex: 1; padding: 10px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; min-width: 0; }
      .dr-row-tall .dr-value { align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 12px; }
      .dr-readonly {
          color: #21252980; color: #313a46; font-weight: 500; font-size: .875rem;
          background: #fbfbfc; border: 1px dashed #dfe3ea; border-radius: 4px;
          padding: 6px 10px; width: 100%;
      }
      .dr-readonly small { display: block; color: #878a99; font-weight: 400; font-size: .68rem; margin-top: 2px; }
      .dr-value .form-control, .dr-value .form-select { font-size: .875rem; }
      .dr-radio-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 28px; }
      .dr-radio { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 500; color: #495057; cursor: pointer; margin: 0; }
      .dr-radio input { width: 16px; height: 16px; cursor: pointer; }

      @media (max-width: 576px) {
          .dr-row { flex-direction: column; }
          .dr-label { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe3ea; flex: 1 1 auto; }
          .dr-form-header { flex-wrap: wrap; }
          .dr-form-header .dr-form-code { margin-left: 0; text-align: left; }
      }

      /* ── "Document(s) Requested" combobox — searchable multi-select with
         removable chips + free-text custom entries (2026-09-02). ── */
      .doc-combo { width: 100%; }
      .doc-combo-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .doc-combo-chips:empty { display: none; }
      .doc-chip {
          display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
          background: #e7ebfa; color: #405189; border: 1px solid #c9d2f5;
          border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 8px 5px 14px; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600;
          max-width: 100%;
      }
      .doc-chip span.doc-chip-label { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; max-width: 320px; }
      .doc-chip button {
          border: none; background: rgba(64,81,137,.14); color: #405189; border-radius: 50%;
          width: 18px; height: 18px; line-height: 1; font-size: .85rem; flex-shrink: 0;
          cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0;
      }
      .doc-chip button:hover { background: rgba(64,81,137,.28); }
      .doc-combo-input-wrap { position: relative; }
      .doc-combo-dropdown {
          position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 4px); left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20;
          background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dfe3ea; border-radius: 8px;
          box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(20,25,45,.14); max-height: 260px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 6px;
      }
      .doc-combo-option {
          padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .85rem; color: #313a46;
          cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      }
      .doc-combo-option:hover, .doc-combo-option.active { background: #f0f2fb; color: #405189; }
      .doc-combo-option.custom { color: #0ab39c; font-weight: 600; }
      .doc-combo-option .doc-combo-option-hint { margin-left: auto; font-size: .68rem; color: #878a99; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3px; }
      .doc-combo-empty { padding: 10px; font-size: .8rem; color: #878a99; text-align: center; }

      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-chip { background: rgba(96,126,224,.18); color: #a9bcf5; border-color: rgba(96,126,224,.35); }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-chip button { background: rgba(169,188,245,.18); color: #a9bcf5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-combo-dropdown { background: #2a2f3c; border-color: #3a4053; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-combo-option { color: #d3d5db; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-combo-option:hover, [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-combo-option.active { background: #363c4c; color: #a9bcf5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .doc-combo-option.custom { color: #4bd1b0; }

      /* ── Dark mode — the rest of this page's custom classes above
         (table card, section tabs, Document Request Form) never got the
         same [data-bs-theme="dark"] treatment as the doc-combo classes
         above, so they stayed hardcoded light. Same dark surface/border/
         text tones used throughout the rest of the app's dark-mode CSS. ── */
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .table-card { background: #1e2533; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .table thead th { background-color: #262d3d; color: #adb5bd; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .table tbody td { border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .badge-soft-pending { background-color: rgba(255,152,0,.15); color: #ffb74d; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .badge-soft-fulfilled { background-color: rgba(76,175,80,.15); color: #81c784; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .badge-soft-rejected { background-color: rgba(244,67,54,.15); color: #e57373; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .section-tab { background: #262d3d; color: #ced4da; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .section-tab:hover { background: #2f3749; color: #7094f5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-form-header { border-bottom-color: #5a72d4; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-form-header .dr-form-title,
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-form-header .dr-form-code { color: #7094f5; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-form-table,
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-row { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-label {
          background: #262d3d; color: #ced4da; border-right-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-readonly {
          background: #1a1f2b; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.15); color: #e9ecef;
      }
      @media (max-width: 576px) {
          [data-bs-theme="dark"] .dr-label { border-bottom-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
      }

      @media (max-width: 576px) {
          .doc-chip span.doc-chip-label { max-width: 200px; }
      }

      /* Submission of Approved MOA/MOU — searchable Country dropdown (same look as the Partner Request form) */
      .cr-country-wrap { position: relative; }
      .cr-country-dropdown {
          position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 4px); left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 20;
          background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dfe3ea; border-radius: 8px;
          box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(20,25,45,.14); max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 6px;
          display: none;
      }
      .cr-country-option { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .85rem; color: #313a46; cursor: pointer; }
      .cr-country-option:hover { background: #f0f2fb; color: #405189; }
      .cr-country-empty { padding: 10px; font-size: .8rem; color: #878a99; text-align: center; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cr-country-dropdown { background: #2a2f3c; border-color: #3a4053; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cr-country-option { color: #d3d5db; }
      [data-bs-theme="dark"] .cr-country-option:hover { background: #363c4c; color: #a9bcf5; }
    </style>
    <!-- Shared Country list (same one the Registry, Reports and the Partner Request form use) -->
    <script src="/velzon/assets/js/shared/country-options.js"></script>
</head>

<body>

<div id="layout-wrapper">
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar_personnel') %>

    <div class="main-content">
        <div class="page-content">
            <div class="container-fluid">

                <!-- Page Title -->
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-12">
                        <div class="page-title-box d-sm-flex align-items-center justify-content-between bg-galaxy-transparent">
                            <h4 class="mb-sm-0">Requests</h4>
                            <div class="page-title-right">
                                <ol class="breadcrumb m-0">
                                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/personnel/monitoring">CIPRMS</a></li>
                                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Requests</li>
                                </ol>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Section switcher: Document Request | Submission of Approved MOA/MOU (same convention as the Partner's Requests page) -->
                <div class="section-tabs">
                    <a class="section-tab active" id="tab-dr" href="#" onclick="switchSection('dr');return false;">
                        <i class="ri-file-shield-2-line"></i> Document Request
                    </a>
                    <a class="section-tab" id="tab-moa" href="#" onclick="switchSection('moa');return false;">
                        <i class="ri-government-line"></i> Submission of Approved MOA/MOU
                    </a>
                    <!-- College Requests (2026-11 follow-up) — MOA/MOU/Accreditation requests Administrator/Staff
                         assign to this Dean specifically; replaces the former standalone College Requests page
                         and its own sidebar item. -->
                    <a class="section-tab" id="tab-cdr" href="#" onclick="switchSection('cdr');return false;">
                        <i class="ri-award-line"></i> College Requests
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- ═══════════ PANEL: DOCUMENT REQUEST ═══════════ -->
                <%# College Dean submits Document Requests and Approved MOA/MOU copies (College Partnership Reports) only —
                    every other Partnership Request action is closed to this role. %>
                <div id="panel-dr">

                    <!-- Submission Form Section -->
                    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
                        <div class="col-lg-12">
                            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <div class="dr-form-header">
                                        <img src="/images/cirl-logo.jpg" alt="CSPC-CIRL">
                                        <div>
                                            <p class="dr-form-title">Documents Request Form</p>
                                            <p class="dr-form-subtitle">Center for International Relations and Linkages — CSPC</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dr-form-code">CSPC-F-CIRL-04</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="alert alert-success d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mt-3 mb-0 d-none" id="dr-success-banner" role="status">
                                        <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill fs-18"></i>
                                        <div>
                                            <strong>Request submitted successfully.</strong>
                                            You can fill out and submit another request below.
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <form id="docRequestForm">
                                        <div class="dr-form-table">
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Name of Requestor</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value"><div class="dr-readonly"><%= user.name %></div></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Office / College / Institution</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value">
                                                    <% if (user.unit) { %>
                                                        <div class="dr-readonly"><%= user.unit %><small>Auto-filled from your profile</small></div>
                                                        <input type="hidden" id="f-inst" value="<%= user.unit %>">
                                                    <% } else { %>
                                                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="f-inst">
                                                    <% } %>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Date / Time</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value"><div class="dr-readonly" id="f-datetime-display">—</div></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Contact No.</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value" style="flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:4px;">
                                                    <% if (typeof contactNumber !== 'undefined' && contactNumber) { %>
                                                        <%# The number entered when the account was registered — fixed, like the office above. %>
                                                        <div class="dr-readonly"><%= contactNumber %><small>Set when your account was registered</small></div>
                                                        <input type="hidden" id="f-contact" value="<%= contactNumber %>">
                                                    <% } else { %>
                                                        <input type="tel" inputmode="numeric" class="form-control" id="f-contact">
                                                    <% } %>
                                                    <div class="form-text text-danger fs-12 mb-0" id="f-contact-warn" style="display:none"><i class="ri-error-warning-line me-1"></i>Numbers only — letters aren't allowed.</div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row dr-row-tall">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Document(s) Requested <span class="text-danger">*</span></div>
                                                <div class="dr-value" style="display:block">
                                                    <div class="doc-combo" id="f-type-combo">
                                                        <div class="doc-combo-chips" id="f-type-chips"></div>
                                                        <div class="doc-combo-input-wrap">
                                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="f-type-input" autocomplete="off" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="listbox">
                                                            <div class="doc-combo-dropdown" id="f-type-dropdown" role="listbox" style="display:none"></div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">Pick a suggestion or type any custom document name, then press Enter or select it to add. You can add multiple.</small>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row dr-row-tall">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Purpose</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value" style="display:block">
                                                    <textarea class="form-control" id="f-notes" rows="4"></textarea>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Document Form</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value dr-radio-group">
                                                    <label class="dr-radio"><input type="radio" name="f-form" value="Printed Copy"> Printed Copy</label>
                                                    <label class="dr-radio"><input type="radio" name="f-form" value="Digital Copy"> Digital Copy</label>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="dr-row">
                                                <div class="dr-label">Email Address</div>
                                                <div class="dr-value"><div class="dr-readonly"><%= user.email %></div></div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-4">
                                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-light px-4" id="clear-req-btn" style="display:none" onclick="resetForm()">Clear</button>
                                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-success px-5 fw-bold" id="submit-req-btn" onclick="submitRequest()">
                                                Submit Request
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-muted fs-13"><i class="ri-information-line me-1"></i>Track the status of everything you've submitted on the <a href="/personnel/monitoring">Monitoring</a> page.</p>

                </div><!-- end panel-dr -->

                <!-- ═══════════ PANEL: SUBMISSION OF APPROVED MOA/MOU (College Partnership Report) ═══════════
                     The college already signed an MOA/MOU with another institution without going through CIRL; the Dean
                     sends CIRL the approved copy so CIRL can record it in the Partnership Registry. -->
                <div id="panel-moa" style="display:none;">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
                        <div class="col-lg-12">
                            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                                <div class="card-body p-4">
                                    <div class="dr-form-header">
                                        <img src="/images/cirl-logo.jpg" alt="CSPC-CIRL">
                                        <div>
                                            <p class="dr-form-title">Send Approved MOA/MOU to CIRL</p>
                                            <p class="dr-form-subtitle">Center for International Relations and Linkages — CSPC</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="alert alert-success d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mt-3 mb-0 d-none" id="cr-success-banner" role="status">
                                        <i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill fs-18"></i>
                                        <div><strong>Sent to CIRL.</strong> <span id="cr-success-text"></span> Track it on <a href="/personnel/monitoring">Monitoring</a>.</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="alert alert-info fs-13 py-2 mt-3">
                                        <i class="ri-information-line me-1"></i>For an agreement your college has <strong>already signed</strong> with another institution.
                                        Reporting college: <strong><%= user.unit ? user.unit : 'your college' %></strong>.
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row g-3">
                                        <div class="col-md-8">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-inst">Partner Institution <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="cr-inst" maxlength="200">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-md-4">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-country">Country <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <div class="cr-country-wrap">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" id="cr-country" autocomplete="off" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="listbox">
                                                <div class="cr-country-dropdown" id="cr-country-dropdown" role="listbox"></div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-md-4">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-type">Agreement Type <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <select class="form-select" id="cr-type">
                                                <option value="">Select…</option><option>MOA</option><option>MOU</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-md-8">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-nature">Nature of Partnership <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <select class="form-select" id="cr-nature">
                                                <option value="">Select…</option>
                                                <option>Research</option><option>Student Exchange</option><option>Joint Program</option>
                                                <option>Faculty Development</option><option>Technology Transfer</option><option>Community Outreach</option><option>Other</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-md-6">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-start">Effective Date <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <input type="date" class="form-control" id="cr-start">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-md-6">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-end">Expiry Date <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <input type="date" class="form-control" id="cr-end">
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-file">Approved (signed) copy <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                                            <input type="file" class="form-control" id="cr-file" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png">
                                            <div class="form-text">PDF, JPG or PNG — max 10MB.</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12">
                                            <label class="form-label" for="cr-notes">Notes for CIRL</label>
                                            <textarea class="form-control" id="cr-notes" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-4">
                                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-success px-5 fw-bold" id="cr-submit-btn" onclick="submitCollegeReport()">
                                            <i class="ri-send-plane-line me-1"></i>Send to CIRL
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-muted fs-13"><i class="ri-information-line me-1"></i>Track what you've sent under <strong>College Partnership Reports</strong> on the <a href="/personnel/monitoring">Monitoring</a> page.</p>
                </div><!-- end panel-moa -->

                <!-- ═══════════ PANEL: COLLEGE REQUESTS (2026-11 follow-up) ═══════════
                     MOA/MOU/Accreditation requests Administrator/Staff assign to this Dean specifically — ported
                     from the former standalone views/auth. personnel/college_requests.ejs page (that route now
                     redirects here). The Dean can only view and submit/resubmit — no accept/return controls are
                     rendered (those are Administrator/Staff-only, enforced server-side by requireStaffAccess on
                     PATCH /api/college-requests/:id regardless of what this page shows). -->
                <div id="panel-cdr" style="display:none;">
                    <p class="text-muted mb-3">MOA, MOU, and Accreditation requests assigned to you by the Administrator/Staff. Open a request to review its instructions and submit the requested documents.</p>

                    <div class="cdr-filter-tabs">
                        <span class="cdr-filter-tab active" data-status="all" onclick="cdrFilterBy('all', this)"><i class="ri-list-check-2"></i> All</span>
                        <span class="cdr-filter-tab" data-status="Pending" onclick="cdrFilterBy('Pending', this)"><i class="ri-time-line"></i> Pending</span>
                        <span class="cdr-filter-tab" data-status="Submitted" onclick="cdrFilterBy('Submitted', this)"><i class="ri-upload-cloud-2-line"></i> Submitted</span>
                        <span class="cdr-filter-tab" data-status="Returned for Revision" onclick="cdrFilterBy('Returned for Revision', this)"><i class="ri-arrow-go-back-line"></i> Returned for Revision</span>
                        <span class="cdr-filter-tab" data-status="Completed" onclick="cdrFilterBy('Completed', this)"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-line"></i> Completed</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card table-card">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                            <div class="table-responsive">
                                <table class="table table-hover mb-0">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>Title</th>
                                            <th>Type</th>
                                            <th>Deadline</th>
                                            <th>Status</th>
                                            <th></th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody id="cdr-table-body">
                                        <tr><td colspan="5" class="text-center text-muted py-4">Loading…</td></tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
